# Tarot Tutor (github.com/riccjohn/tarot-tutor) is built and hosted on
# GitHub Pages under /tarot-tutor/. Proxy that path through so it reads
# as arcanegrain.dev/tarot-tutor/; 200 rewrites rather than redirects.
# No separate trailing-slash rule: Netlify matches /tarot-tutor and
# /tarot-tutor/ alike, so one would redirect to itself forever.
/tarot-tutor/*  https://riccjohn.github.io/tarot-tutor/:splat  200
